<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $2.25 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $2.25 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.25 lower. Trade moderately active. Top $56.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     56.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     55.50-56.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     53.50-55.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     50.00-53.00</p>
<p>Sows:  300-500 lbs mostly steady; 500-700 lbs steady to 1.00 lower. Top 50.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs     46.50</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs     47.50-48.00</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     48.50</p>
<p>	   550-600 lbs     49.50-50.00</p>
<p>	   600-700 lbs     50.50</p>
</text>
